book_108,Comic tragedies,Louisa May Alcott,ol26680a,Khoa học viễn tưởng,"Fans of Louisa May Alcott's Little Women will remember the elaborate plays which the March sisters loved to perform. This volume, published after Alcott's death, is a compilation of the real plays written by her and her sisters, which were fictionalized in *Little Women*.",1893,9798611923603,Independently Published,119,Tiếng Anh,,https://covers.openlibrary.org/b/id/2500308-L.jpg,0.0,False,"Melodrama, Fiction, Juvenile fiction, Bibliography, Portrait",,,,,False,,,,,
