book_163,Inside UFO 54-40,Edward Packard,ol26684a,Khoa học viễn tưởng,"You are abducted by aliens known as the U-Ty Masters to be placed in their zoo. This book is notorious for having an ending that requires ""cheating"" to reach as it cannot be found by following page numbers listed throughout the book.",1982,9780553201970,Bantam Books,118,Tiếng Anh,Mass Market Paperback,https://covers.openlibrary.org/b/id/6979939-L.jpg,0.0,False,"Unidentified flying objects, Plot-your-own stories, Fiction, collectionID:CYOA1",,,,,False,,,,,
